(PUBLIC HEALTH ENGINEERING DEPARTMENT — Tender EE/CIV/19/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This specification covers supply and installation of borewell submersible) Tj T*
(pumpsets and water quality testing complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — BOREWELL SUBMERSIBLE PUMPSETS) Tj T*
(\(a\) Borewell submersible pumpsets shall conform to IS 8034:2018.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Each pumpset shall deliver 18 m3/hr against a total head of 90 m.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Motors shall be water filled, wet type, conforming to IS 9283:2013.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Submersible flat cables shall be 3 core, 6 mm², copper conductor, PVC) Tj T*
(insulated, conforming to IS 694:2010 and tested as per IS 10810. Each pumpset) Tj T*
(shall be provided with an automatic starter with single phasing preventer and) Tj T*
(dry run protection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(\(a\) Treated water supplied shall conform to IS 10500:2012.) Tj T*
(\(b\) pH of treated water shall be between 6.5 and 8.5.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Total dissolved solids shall not exceed 500 mg/l.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Turbidity shall not be more than 5 NTU.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Fluoride shall not exceed 1.0 mg/l.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Nitrate shall not exceed 45 mg/l. Arsenic shall not exceed 0.01 mg/l.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Total hardness as CaCO3 shall not exceed 200 mg/l.) Tj T*
(\(h\) E. coli shall not be detectable in any 100 ml sample.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Pumpsets shall bear the BIS Standard Mark.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Water samples shall be tested in a NABL accredited laboratory as per IS 3025) Tj T*
(and IS 1622.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The equipment shall be inspected by the Engineer-in-charge at the) Tj T*
(manufacturer's works before dispatch.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 4) Tj T*
